Object.assign(DIALOG_CLIPS.clips,{"tom|I got it. The library is whispering.":"","rose|A book told me Boppy eats cookies in the car. In the CAR, Tata. Before DINNER.":"","tom|...That one is true. Everybody knows that one.":"","grace|Twelve.":"","page|Oh! Tom. Girls. Welcome to the Hush Library. Everything is fine.":"","tom|Books overhear things.":"","rose|Are there monsters down there? Say yes.":"","page|The Reading Room doors use the old card catalog lock. I lost the password in 1998.":"","page|There are three sections. Fiction, Nonfiction and Picture Books. And the Reading Room, at the very back.":"","grace|I have read every book in the kids section. Twice. I can read ALL the signs.":"","rose|Tata. Tata. The books are looking at us.":"","grace|FICTION is that way. NONFICTION is that way. PICTURE BOOKS are down there. The READING ROOM is at the top.":"","tom|Somebody down here knows the password. We ask nicely. Then we ask less nicely.":"","bigone|And then... the uncle walked into Fiction... and he saw... he saw...":"","tom|Saw what.":"","bigone|Find out next time!":"","rose|Tata. What did you see? When you walked into Fiction?":"","grace|The first letter is circled in gold pen. S.":"","tom|A password for the Reading Room. In card order.":"","tom|A green book being very dramatic.":"","grump|Actually, you said it bossy.":"","grace|Actually, I KNOW that. Actually, I said it right.":"","grace|It does NOT sound like me. Tata. Tell her.":"","rose|Tata. It sounds like Grace.":"","grace|...Okay. I can work on the telling part. A little. Starting tomorrow.":"","grace|The first letter is circled in gold pen. H.":"","toad|BOO!":"","rose|AAAAH!":"","toad|...Boo?":"","rose|BOOOOOOO!":"","grace|Rose. You scared a book.":"","rose|Tata, did you see? I scared it back. It was TERRIFIED.":"","rose|Tata. The door talked.":"","grace|It dropped a card! An old catalog card. It says CARD 3 OF 3, and the title is HUSH, LITTLE LAMBY.":"","tom|The thing behind the door talked. Stay close.":"","log|...Visitors. Nobody comes to the Reading Room. Nobody has come since 1952.":"","log|So I listened. Everybody who ever sat in this room thought nobody could hear them. I heard ALL of it.":"","rose|You told everybody Boppy eats cookies in the car.":"","log|Then read me. Go on. Nobody ever does.":"","tom|Girls, behind me. No touching, please.":"","log|He does. In the CAR.":"","grace|And look. The checkout card, in the pocket. One stamp. DUE BACK 1952. No name. Just a little clock.":"","tom|And brought it back with a coin in it. Look at those corners. Very neat.":"","grace|Somebody DID open it, then. To put the coin in.":"","page|Grace. This is for you. A Gold Library Card. No limit. No late fees. Ever.":"","page|And sweaters. I knit one every winter. I have run out of people. Please take some.":"","tom|...Bready Mercury is going to need a bigger jar.":"","skeeter|Everybody uses me and then forgets which page I was on.":"","skeeter|SHHHH! Again!":"","skeeter|Round 4. Quietly. SHHH.":"","skeeter|Round 5. Quietly. SHHH.":"","skeeter|Round 2. Quietly. SHHH.":"","skeeter|I mark your place. Nobody marks mine.":"","skeeter|...shhh. Shhhh. Shh.":"","log|Unfolded! Round two!":"","log|Round 2. Still creased.":"","skeeter|Round 3. Quietly. SHHH.":"","log|Round 3. Still creased.":"","log|Round 4. Still creased.":"","log|Round 5. Still creased.":"","log|...somebody folded me. Somebody always folds me.":"","bigone|Previously, on this fight...":"","bigone|Round 2. And then... and then...":"","bigone|Round 3. And then... and then...":"","bigone|Round 4. And then... and then...":"","bigone|Round 5. And then... and then...":"","bigone|Nobody ever finishes me. They read the first chapter and put me back. Every time.":"","bigone|...and then... and THEN...":"","grump|Nobody looks things up anymore. They just ask their phones. Their phones are WRONG.":"","grump|Kangaroo. Kettle. Kindness. I know them all. Nobody asks.":"","grump|Correction! Round two!":"","grump|Round 2. Footnote 2.":"","grump|Round 3. Footnote 3.":"","grump|Round 4. Footnote 4.":"","grump|Round 5. Footnote 5.":"","grump|...actually. Actually. Ac-tu-al-ly.":"","toad|BOO! Again!":"","toad|Round 2. Surprise!":"","toad|Round 3. Surprise!":"","toad|Round 4. Surprise!":"","toad|Round 5. Surprise!":"","toad|...boo. Boo? No? Nobody?":"","bigone|Find out next time. Same shelf. Same book.":"","toad|Kids open me and scream. Then they laugh. Then they open me again. I love it.":"","log|Seventy years on this shelf. Nobody has opened me once.":"","log|You hear things, when nobody reads you. You hear EVERYTHING.":"","log|Chapter two. Again.":"","log|Round 4. Page 4.":"","log|Round 5. Page 5.":"","log|Round 3. Page 3.":"","log|I know what you whispered. I know what everybody whispered.":"","log|Round 2. Page 2.":"","sal|She said, and I quote, \"tell Tata the library is being WEIRD.\" She hung up before I could ask how.":"","log|...nobody. Not once. Since 1952.":"","rose|THAT IS WHAT I DO.":"","rose|I can read PICTURES. Pictures are harder.":"","grace|It dropped a card! An old catalog card. It says CARD 1 OF 3, and the title is SECRETS OF THE SOUP DUMPLING.":"","tom|You know a lot. And you tell people. Those are two different things, and only one of them needs a little work.":"","toad|AAAAH!":"","grace|It dropped a card! An old catalog card. It says CARD 2 OF 3, and the title is HOW TO WHISPER, VOLUME 2.":"","tom|A gold coin. Same little clock face.":"","grace|Tata, something fell out of it. Something gold. It was being used as a bookmark.":"","grace|Tata, it TELLS us its chapter. Mystery, Chatter. Adventure, Kinetic. Read the message. And maybe somebody should just read it. Out loud. Three times.":"","page|Story time is Saturdays now. The Unread asked for Grace. By name.":"","tom|The sundial. The steamer. The sign-up sheet. My jar. Now a book nobody has opened since 1952.":""});
Object.assign(DIALOG_CLIPS.voices,{"grace":{"model":"eleven_v4","direction":"","designed":false,"voice_id":"i4CzbCVWoqvD0P1QJCUL","name":"Ivy","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8}},"tom":{"voice_id":"cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal","name":"Eric - Smooth, Trustworthy","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.85},"direction":"","designed":false},"rose":{"voice_id":"ocZQ262SsZb9RIxcQBOj","name":"Lulu Lolipop - High-Pitched and Bubbly  (female, young, american, characters_animation)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.85},"direction":"","designed":false},"page":{"voice_id":"UnNThlnnIcLaHiWDpFdl","name":"AoT Page","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his forties, a librarian with a hushed, dry, whispery American voice. Speaks very quietly and precisely, mildly scandalized by everything, droll. Soft breathy whisper. Clean studio recording."},"bigone":{"voice_id":"qDteMRfOWoUEc7kcfWvl","name":"AoT The Big One","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"An enormous ancient cartoon pond fish, huge slow booming bass voice with gurgling bubbles, pompous and boastful but childlike and easily delighted underneath. Animated character voice."},"grump":{"voice_id":"moX2FuSiiLmOw0uEq4OU","name":"AoT Pond Grump","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A grumpy cartoon swamp creature, low gravelly grumbling voice, cranky and wet-sounding, easily offended, a big softie underneath. Animated character voice."},"toad":{"voice_id":"jcb48kKcDpNXjAxnAP2c","name":"AoT Bog Toad","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A huge cartoon toad, deep croaky throaty voice with a rumbling ribbit, territorial and proud, a bit vain. Animated character voice."},"log":{"voice_id":"DmA9AOv6Fsic2LQdqVVM","name":"AoT Log Lump","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A sleepy cartoon log creature, very slow, deep, woody and drowsy voice, yawning between words, mumbly and content. Animated character voice."},"skeeter":{"voice_id":"3NkCp1SubvPIw3g0s7Rf","name":"AoT Skeeter Swarm","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A cartoon swarm of mosquitoes speaking as one, high-pitched, thin, whiny and buzzy voice with a nasal zzz on every s, nosy and impatient. Animated character voice."},"amy":{"model":"eleven_v4","direction":"","designed":false,"voice_id":"R3ZxkaLekDWMqVjuSScJ","name":"AoT Amy (Long Island)","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8}},"deedee":{"model":"eleven_v4","direction":"","designed":false,"voice_id":"3atomJkX2UWSHPSg86Z0","name":"AoT Deedee (Long Island)","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8}},"boppy":{"voice_id":"QzTKubutNn9TjrB7Xb2Q","name":"Jerry B. - New York Italian Mobster  (male, middle_aged, new york, characters_animation)","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":1},"direction":"deep gravelly voice","designed":false},"sal":{"voice_id":"gcJ5PkVgShIxtP5HgbZK","name":"AoT Sal","model":"eleven_v4","settings":{"stability":0.5,"similarity_boost":0.8},"direction":"","designed":true,"desc":"A man in his fifties with a thick Long Island New York accent, a slightly nasal, raspy, fast and friendly voice. Chatty taxi driver, warm and a little dramatic, proud of his one cab. Clean studio recording."}});
